00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:55.280
<i>the faith and the apparition...</i>

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.460
<i>continue.</i>

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:59.130
It'd be nice if they rebuilt it.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:05.280
If the shrine is rebuilt, that place probably
won't be an energy drift for those bad things.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.290
By then Kuchinawa —

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:14.040
I mean, the Snake God will be back at that shrine, too.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:15.780
Right, Koyomi-oniichan?

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:16.840
Yeah.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.920
It'd be nice if that happened.

